.         // el drop preg114b-preg114l4 elimina variables que sí se usan dentro
>  de
.         // Outliers (los helpers leen preg114b1, preg114g1, preg114ge, etc.) 
> y
.         // porque ClassifySamples ya no las necesita (depende solo de ppc_id/
> post).
.         //-------------------------------------------------------------------
> -------
.         {
.                 sort ppc_id post
.                 drop preg114b-preg114l4
.                 compress
  variable pp_id was float now int
  variable ppc_id was float now int
  variable stayer_line was float now byte
  variable tipo_predio was float now byte
  (67,990 bytes saved)
.         }
. }

